  "$comment": "Primary-source oracle — 30-year integrated projection workbook. Expected values derived INDEPENDENTLY from the cited statutory sources (see derivation), never from production code. Zero-inflation model: the 2026 statutory tables apply unchanged to every projection year; the OBBBA senior deduction expires after tax year 2028.",
  "domain": "integrated-30-year",
